#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"B<size_t strspn(const char *>I<s>B<, const char *>I<accept>B<);>\n"
"B<size_t strcspn(const char *>I<s>B<, const char *>I<reject>B<);>\n"
msgstr ""
"B<size_t strspn(const char *>I<s>B<, const char *>I<accepta>B<);>\n"
"B<size_t strcspn(const char *>I<s>B<, const char *>I<rechaza>B<);>\n"

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPCIÓN"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strspn>()  function calculates the length (in bytes) of the initial "
"segment of I<s> which consists entirely of bytes in I<accept>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strspn>() calcula la longitud del segmento inicial (en bytes ) "
"de I<s> que consta únicamente de caracteres en I<acepta>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strcspn>()  function calculates the length of the initial segment of "
"I<s> which consists entirely of bytes not in I<reject>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strcspn>() calcula la longitud del segmento inicial de I<s> que "
"consta únicamente de bytes que no aparecen en I<rechaza>."

#. type: SH
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "RETURN VALUE"
msgstr "VALOR DEVUELTO"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strspn>()  function returns the number of bytes in the initial segment "
"of I<s> which consist only of bytes from I<accept>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strspn>() devuelve el número de caracteres del segmento inicial "
"de I<s> que contiene sólo bytes perteneciantes a I<acepta>."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"The B<strcspn>()  function returns the number of bytes in the initial "
"segment of I<s> which are not in the string I<reject>."
msgstr ""
"La función B<strcspn>() devuelve el número de caracteres del segmento "
"inicial de I<s> que consta únicamente de caracteres que no están en "
"I<rechaza>."

